      "primary_handler_va": "0x55D6BCE8",
      "descriptor_table_va": "0x55E67E7C",
      "summary": "2-page icon grid presenting all 22 Venus Engine IV scene modes (Portrait, Soft Skin, Transform, Self-Portrait, Scenery, Sports, Night Portrait, Night Scenery, Food, Party, Candle Light, Baby 1/2, Pet, Sunset, High Sensitivity, Hi-Speed Burst, Starry Sky, Fireworks, Beach, Snow, Aerial Photo, Underwater) plus SID 0x0143..0x0190 help descriptions."
